# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 1:1
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. Clear mountain spring water flowing over smooth grey stones into a still pool, a simple porcelain gaiwan tea bowl resting on the rocky bank catching a trickle of water. Misty layered mountains fade into pale washed background. Soft monochrome ink with a faint celadon-green tint, wet brush, generous negative space, tranquil and minimal. No text, no lettering.
